# Story lines follow intro_script.tsv order.
msgid "你睡了吗？"
msgstr "Are you awake?"

msgid "能来接我吗"
msgstr "Can you come get me?"

msgid "现在？"
msgstr "Now?"

msgid "你终于舍得回消息了。你这几天去哪了？"
msgstr "You finally texted back. Where have you been?"

msgid "我还在之前说过的那家旅馆"
msgstr "I'm still at that hotel I told you about"

msgid "他们不让我离开"
msgstr "They won't let me leave"

msgid "“他们”是谁？"
msgstr "Who are “they”?"

msgid "你先把地址发给我。"
msgstr "Send me the address first."

msgid "三楼"
msgstr "Third floor"

msgid "309号房"
msgstr "Room 309"

msgid "你报警了吗？"
msgstr "Did you call the police?"

msgid "我现在给你打电话。"
msgstr "I'm calling you now."

msgid "电话只响一声便挂断。"
msgstr "The call rings once, then disconnects."

msgid "不要打"
msgstr "Don't call"

msgid "他们会听见"
msgstr "They'll hear it"

msgid "谁会听见？"
msgstr "Who will hear it?"

msgid "你房间里有人？"
msgstr "Is someone in your room?"

msgid "“对方正在输入”出现又消失。"
msgstr "“Typing…” appears, then vanishes."

msgid "别相信这里的工作人员"
msgstr "Don't trust the staff here"

msgid "他们看起来和正常人一样"
msgstr "They look just like normal people"

msgid "什么意思？"
msgstr "What do you mean?"

msgid "我现在不能继续发消息了"
msgstr "I can't keep texting"

msgid "快一点"
msgstr "Hurry"

msgid "女主再拨，显示“对方暂时无法接听”。她翻到几天前的兼职录取通知。"
msgstr "An calls again. “The person you are calling is unavailable.” She scrolls back to the job offer from a few days ago."

msgid "那家旅馆……"
msgstr "That hotel…"

msgid "就是她之前提过的夜班兼职。"
msgstr "It's the night shift job she told me about."

msgid "几天前，傍晚的咖啡馆。两杯饮料放在桌上，闺蜜把手机递给女主。"
msgstr "A few days earlier, at a café at dusk. Two drinks sit on the table. An's friend hands her the phone."

msgid "看，我找到兼职了！"
msgstr "Look, I got a part-time job!"

msgid "你上次也是这么说的。"
msgstr "That's what you said last time."

msgid "上次那个发传单的不算。这个有正式录取通知。"
msgstr "Handing out flyers doesn't count. This one has an official offer."

msgid "夜班，三天，工作内容写的是协助前台和整理客房。"
msgstr "Three nights. It says I'll help at the desk and tidy up the guest rooms."

msgid "工资比我上个月做的几份兼职加起来还多。"
msgstr "It pays more than all the jobs I worked last month put together."

msgid "夜班、工作轻松、工资还特别高。"
msgstr "Night shifts, easy work, and unusually good pay."

msgid "这三个词放在一起，通常不像什么好消息。"
msgstr "Put those three together and it usually spells trouble."

msgid "你能不能偶尔对我的人生有一点信心？"
msgstr "Could you have a little faith in my life choices for once?"

msgid "我对你有信心。"
msgstr "I have faith in you."

msgid "我对这种连招聘负责人名字都没写的旅馆没信心。"
msgstr "I don't have faith in a hotel that won't even say who's hiring."

msgid "人家可能只是管理比较传统。"
msgstr "Maybe they're just old-fashioned."

msgid "传统到没有联系电话？"
msgstr "Too old-fashioned for a phone number?"

msgid "有地址就行。我去看看，不对劲就回来。"
msgstr "There's an address. I'll check it out and leave if anything feels off."

msgid "旅馆叫什么？"
msgstr "What's the hotel called?"

msgid "夜班旅馆。"
msgstr "Night Shift Hotel."

msgid "这是名字，还是在提醒你工作时间？"
msgstr "Is that the name or a reminder of your hours?"

msgid "是不是挺有氛围的？"
msgstr "It's kind of atmospheric, right?"

msgid "挺像恐怖电影开头的。"
msgstr "Kind of like the opening of a horror movie."

msgid "恐怖电影里的人要是都像你一样谨慎，电影十分钟就结束了。"
msgstr "If everyone in horror movies were as careful as you, they'd be over in ten minutes."

msgid "等一下。"
msgstr "Wait."

msgid "这里写着“员工离店须经管理部门批准”。"
msgstr "It says, “Staff must obtain management approval before leaving the hotel.”"

msgid "大概是夜班不能随便旷工吧。"
msgstr "It probably just means you can't ditch your shift."

msgid "正常公司会写“离职流程”，不会写“离店批准”。"
msgstr "A normal company would say “resignation procedure,” not “approval to leave the premises.”"

msgid "我就做几天，又不是卖给他们了。"
msgstr "It's a few shifts. It's not like they own me."

msgid "等我拿到工资，请你吃顿好的。"
msgstr "When I get paid, dinner's on me."

msgid "先把地址发给我。"
msgstr "Send me the address first."

msgid "发你了，女侦探。"
msgstr "Sent, Detective."

msgid "每天结束给我回一条消息。"
msgstr "Text me at the end of every shift."

msgid "知道了。我要是少回一条，你是不是准备直接冲进去找我？"
msgstr "Okay. If I miss one text, are you going to come charging in after me?"

msgid "我会先报警。"
msgstr "I'll call the police first."

msgid "你这人真没情趣。"
msgstr "You're no fun."

msgid "闺蜜笑着靠回卡座。画面淡出，录取通知的那行小字短暂停留。"
msgstr "Her friend laughs and leans back in the booth. The scene fades, leaving the fine print on the job offer for a moment."

msgid "她去上班以后，每天晚上都会给我发消息。"
msgstr "She texted me every night after she started working there."

msgid "三天前，消息突然停了。"
msgstr "Three days ago, the messages stopped."

msgid "女主从聊天记录里打开旧地址，拿起外套和钥匙。"
msgstr "An opens the old address from their chat, then grabs her coat and keys."

msgid "没有联系电话，也查不到正常的订房页面。"
msgstr "There's no phone number or proper booking page."

msgid "如果她真的被困在里面，我不能继续等。"
msgstr "If she's really trapped in there, I can't keep waiting."

msgid "雨夜旅馆外景，暖光只从入口透出。"
msgstr "Rain falls outside the hotel. Only the entrance gives off a warm light."

msgid "三楼，309。"
msgstr "Third floor. Room 309."

msgid "先找到她，再弄清楚这里发生了什么。"
msgstr "Find her first. Then figure out what happened here."

msgid "怪物员工通道"
msgstr "Monster Staff Access"

msgid "晚上好。"
msgstr "Good evening."

msgid "这个时间很少有客人独自前来。"
msgstr "We rarely see guests arrive alone at this hour."

msgid "我不是来住店的。我来找人。"
msgstr "I'm not staying here. I'm looking for someone."

msgid "找客人，还是找员工？"
msgstr "A guest or an employee?"

msgid "她之前在这里做夜班兼职。"
msgstr "She took a part-time night shift here."

msgid "这里的夜班人员很多，流动也很快。"
msgstr "We have a lot of night staff. People come and go."

msgid "如果没有名字或者登记编号，我恐怕很难帮你。"
msgstr "Without a name or a registration number, I'm afraid I can't help much."

msgid "她已经三天没有回家了。"
msgstr "She hasn't come home in three days."

msgid "年轻人临时改变计划，并不罕见。"
msgstr "It's hardly unusual for young people to change their plans."

msgid "她刚刚给我发了消息。"
msgstr "She just texted me."

msgid "她说自己在三楼，309号房。"
msgstr "She said she's on the third floor, in Room 309."

msgid "309？"
msgstr "309?"

msgid "你知道那个房间。"
msgstr "You know the room."

msgid "我当然知道旅馆里的房间。"
msgstr "Of course I know the rooms in this hotel."

msgid "那她是不是在那里？"
msgstr "So is she in there?"

msgid "309属于客房区域。"
msgstr "309 is in the guest wing."

msgid "普通访客最好不要随便进入。"
msgstr "Visitors would do well to stay out."

msgid "她不是客人。她是你们招进来的员工。"
msgstr "She's not a guest. You hired her."

msgid "员工是否仍在职，需要查看完整登记。"
msgstr "I'd have to check the full register to see if she's still on staff."

msgid "可惜，这里的记录没有你想象中那么简单。"
msgstr "Unfortunately, our records aren't quite that simple."

msgid "她说有人不让她离开。"
msgstr "She says someone won't let her leave."

msgid "“不能离开”和“手续尚未完成”，听起来相似，含义却完全不同。"
msgstr "“Can't leave” and “hasn't finished the paperwork” may sound similar. They mean very different things."

msgid "对被困在里面的人来说，没有区别。"
msgstr "Not to the person trapped inside."

msgid "你似乎已经认定这里发生了什么。"
msgstr "You seem to have made up your mind about what happened here."

msgid "我只知道她在向我求救。"
msgstr "All I know is that she's asking me for help."

msgid "那么你应该更谨慎一些。"
msgstr "Then you should be more careful."

msgid "这是提醒，还是威胁？"
msgstr "Is that a warning or a threat?"

msgid "是建议。"
msgstr "It's advice."

msgid "楼上的客人有自己的规矩。"
msgstr "The guests upstairs have rules of their own."

msgid "什么规矩？"
msgstr "What rules?"

msgid "有些客人不喜欢陌生人。"
msgstr "Some guests don't like strangers."

msgid "如果你看起来不像这里的工作人员，他们可能会对你产生兴趣。"
msgstr "If you don't look like staff, they may take an interest in you."

msgid "“产生兴趣”是什么意思？"
msgstr "What do you mean, “take an interest”?"

msgid "我建议你不要亲自确认。"
msgstr "I suggest you don't find out firsthand."

msgid "还有些客人对气味非常敏感。"
msgstr "Other guests are very sensitive to smells."

msgid "他们判断一个人的方式，和我们不太一样。"
msgstr "They size people up a little differently than we do."

msgid "楼上住的到底是什么人？"
msgstr "Who exactly is staying upstairs?"

msgid "住客。"
msgstr "Guests."

msgid "你知道我问的不是这个。"
msgstr "You know that's not what I was asking."

msgid "而我能回答的只有这个。"
msgstr "It's the only answer I can give you."

msgid "楼上传来关门声，女主看向楼梯。"
msgstr "A door shuts upstairs. An looks toward the stairs."

msgid "我要去三楼。"
msgstr "I'm going to the third floor."

msgid "你可以先上二楼。"
msgstr "You can start with the second floor."

msgid "如果楼上的客人拦住你，最好听清他们需要什么。"
msgstr "If a guest stops you up there, listen carefully to what they need."

msgid "然后呢？"
msgstr "Then what?"

msgid "完成工作的人，通常更容易得到通行。"
msgstr "People who get their work done usually have an easier time getting through."

msgid "我不是这里的员工。"
msgstr "I don't work here."

msgid "身份这种东西，在这里主要取决于你佩戴什么。"
msgstr "Around here, who you are mostly depends on what you're wearing."

msgid "如果我遇到麻烦呢？"
msgstr "And if I get into trouble?"

msgid "记得找工作人员。"
msgstr "Ask a member of staff."

msgid "包括你吗？"
msgstr "Does that include you?"

msgid "前台永远愿意为客人提供帮助。"
msgstr "The front desk is always happy to help its guests."

msgid "我说过，我不是客人。"
msgstr "I told you, I'm not a guest."

msgid "现在还不是。"
msgstr "Not yet."

msgid "经理低头继续看登记簿。"
msgstr "The manager looks down and goes back to reading the register."

msgid "她知道我朋友在309。"
msgstr "She knows my friend's in 309."

msgid "她也知道是谁不让她离开。"
msgstr "She also knows who's keeping her there."

msgid "但在找到她以前，我还不能和这里的人翻脸。"
msgstr "But I can't pick a fight with these people until I've found her."

# A: Room 202 integration and task feedback.

msgid "我是202的住客。清洁工作完成了？我还有一件遗失的包裹。"
msgstr "I'm the guest in Room 202. Finished cleaning? I have a missing parcel for you to find."

msgid "接受任务后，你有180秒。先返回一楼，在保安身后长按E取得工作证。"
msgstr "You have 180 seconds after accepting. Return to 1F and hold E behind the guard to take the Security ID."

msgid "按Q把保安证切为当前身份，再到我门前的保管柜按E领取包裹。只放在备用槽不行。"
msgstr "Press Q to make the Security ID active. Then press E at the cabinet outside my room to collect the parcel. Keeping the ID in the standby slot will not work."

msgid "取到后回202按E交付，我才会开放通往三楼的路。现在请确认是否接受。"
msgstr "Bring it back to Room 202 and press E to turn it in. Then I will open the way to 3F. Decide whether to accept the task."

msgid "独眼客 · 202"
msgstr "One-Eyed Guest · 202"

msgid "所需身份：%s · 接受后限时 %d 秒\n返回一楼在保安身后取证 → Q切为当前保安\n返回二楼保管柜按E领取 → 回202交付。"
msgstr "Required: %s · %d seconds after accepting\nReturn to 1F for the guard's ID → Q to make it active\nReturn to the 2F cabinet → E to collect → Room 202."

msgid "%s / 本次任务"
msgstr "%s / Current Task"

msgid "在202接受180秒包裹任务"
msgstr "Accept the 180-second parcel task at Room 202"

msgid "返回一楼，在保安身后长按E取证"
msgstr "Return to 1F; hold E behind the guard for the ID"

msgid "到保管柜按E领取包裹"
msgstr "Press E at the cabinet to collect the parcel"

msgid "Q切保安身份，到保管柜按E领取"
msgstr "Q: Security ID → E: Collect parcel"

msgid "带包裹回202按E交付"
msgstr "Bring the parcel to Room 202 and press E to turn it in"

msgid "202已交付；二楼右梯可上3F"
msgstr "Room 202 complete; use the right stairs on 2F to reach 3F"

msgid "回202重新接受；201成果保留"
msgstr "Accept again at Room 202; Room 201 progress is kept"

msgid "201已完成；向右到202接包裹任务"
msgstr "Room 201 complete; head right to Room 202 for the parcel task"

msgid "回到202接受前，保留201成果，撤销本任务保安卡与包裹。"
msgstr "Return to before accepting at Room 202. Keep Room 201 progress; undo the Security ID and parcel gained during this task."

msgid "202包裹任务待接受：一楼保安取证 → Q切保安 → 二楼保管柜领取 → 回202交付。"
msgstr "Room 202 · Parcel task available. Read the details to accept."

msgid "任务已接受：回一楼在保安身后取证，Q切保安身份，返回二楼保管柜领取，再回202交付。"
msgstr "Task accepted · Guard's ID → Q: Security → Cabinet → Room 202"

msgid "当前目标：%s"
msgstr "Current objective: %s"

msgid "在202面板接受包裹任务，接受后开始180秒计时。"
msgstr "Accept the parcel task at Room 202. The 180-second clock starts when you accept."

msgid "返回一楼，在保安身后长按E取得工作证。"
msgstr "Return to 1F and hold E behind the guard for the Security ID."

msgid "到保管柜按E领取包裹。"
msgstr "Press E at the cabinet to collect the parcel."

msgid "Q切到保安身份，再到保管柜按E领取包裹。"
msgstr "Press Q to make Security active, then press E at the cabinet to collect the parcel."

msgid "带包裹回202按E交付。"
msgstr "Bring the parcel to Room 202 and press E to turn it in."

msgid "202已交付，可从二楼右梯上3F；当前试玩到三楼入口。"
msgstr "Room 202 complete. Take the right stairs on 2F to 3F. This demo ends at the 3F entrance."

msgid "重新挑战本任务，回202重新接受；201成果保留。"
msgstr "Retry and accept the task again at Room 202. Room 201 progress is kept."

msgid "前往202。"
msgstr "Go to Room 202."

msgid "201已交付；向右到202接包裹任务。"
msgstr "Room 201 complete. Head right to Room 202 for the parcel task."

msgid "先接受对应任务并切到所需当前身份；清理须长按 E，包裹柜按 E 领取。"
msgstr "Accept the task and activate the required ID first. Hold E to clean; press E at the cabinet to collect the parcel."

msgid "%s需要当前%s身份；按Q切换到对应工作证后通过。"
msgstr "Room %s requires the %s ID to be active. Press Q to switch to it before passing."

msgid "%s身份核对通过，可以继续前进。"
msgstr "Room %s: ID verified. You may continue."

msgid "包裹已领取，在202按E交付。"
msgstr "Parcel collected. Press E at Room 202 to turn it in."

msgid "202任务进行中：取得保安证，切为当前身份，再去保管柜领取包裹。"
msgstr "Room 202 task in progress: get the Security ID, make it active, then collect the parcel at the cabinet."

msgid "保管柜 · 当前保安身份 · E领取"
msgstr "Parcel cabinet · Security ID · E: Collect"

msgid "202包裹交付后开放后段"
msgstr "Turn in parcel at Room 202 to pass"

# A: Task03 manager approval, confirmed D-05/D-07.

msgid "202已交付；上3F到302接授权任务"
msgstr "Room 202 complete; go to Room 302 on 3F"

msgid "202已交付；从二楼右梯上3F，到302接受管理授权任务。"
msgstr "Room 202 complete. Take the right stairs to 3F and accept the approval task at Room 302."

msgid "302管理授权任务待接受：回1F取经理证，装备并切为当前身份，回3F登记台批准。"
msgstr "Room 302 · Approval task available. Read the details to accept."

msgid "309 · 先取得管理批准"
msgstr "Room 309 · Manager approval required"

msgid "309 · 取得管理批准后开放"
msgstr "Room 309 · Requires manager approval"

msgid "309尚未获准；先完成302的管理授权任务。"
msgstr "Room 309 is not approved. Complete the approval task from Room 302 first."

msgid "309登记台 · 当前经理身份 · E批准"
msgstr "309 register · Manager ID · E: Approve"

msgid "309登记已批准；任务03完成"
msgstr "Room 309 approved; Task 03 complete"

msgid "309登记已批准；任务03完成，救援后续尚未开放。"
msgstr "Room 309 approved; Task 03 complete. The rescue sequence is not available yet."

msgid "309登记已批准；救援后续尚未开放。"
msgstr "Room 309 approved. The rescue sequence is not available yet."

msgid "3F登记台按E批准309"
msgstr "3F register · E: Approve Room 309"

msgid "3F登记台按E批准309。"
msgstr "Press E at the register on 3F to approve Room 309."

msgid "I将经理证放入佩戴槽"
msgstr "I: Equip the Manager ID in a slot"

msgid "I将经理证放入佩戴槽。"
msgstr "Press I and equip the Manager ID in a slot."

msgid "Q切为经理，再回3F登记台批准。"
msgstr "Press Q to make Manager active, then use the register on 3F."

msgid "Q切为经理，回3F登记台批准"
msgstr "Q: Manager ID → 3F register"

msgid "任务已接受：回1F取经理证，I装备、Q切当前身份，再回3F登记台按E批准309。"
msgstr "Task accepted · Manager ID on 1F → I: Equip → Q: Activate → 3F register"

msgid "前往3F的302。"
msgstr "Go to Room 302 on 3F."

msgid "回1F取得经理证，装备并切为当前身份，再到3F登记台按E批准309。"
msgstr "Get the Manager ID on 1F, equip and activate it, then press E at the register on 3F."

msgid "回1F经理身后长按E取得工作证。"
msgstr "Hold E behind the manager on 1F to take the Manager ID."

msgid "回1F经理身后长按E取证"
msgstr "Hold E behind the manager on 1F"

msgid "回302重新接受；201／202成果保留"
msgstr "Retry at Room 302; keep Rooms 201/202"

msgid "回302重新接受；201／202成果保留。"
msgstr "Accept again at Room 302. Progress in Rooms 201 and 202 is kept."

msgid "回三楼，在309附近登记台按E批准；批准即完成任务并停表，不用回302交付。"
msgstr "Return to the register near Room 309 on 3F and press E to approve. Approval completes the task and stops the clock. No return to Room 302 is needed."

msgid "回到302接受前，保留201／202成果，撤销本任务经理卡与批准。"
msgstr "Return to before accepting at Room 302. Keep Rooms 201/202 progress; undo the Manager ID and approval gained during this task."

msgid "在302接受240秒授权任务"
msgstr "Accept the 240-second task at Room 302"

msgid "在302接受240秒授权任务。"
msgstr "Accept the 240-second approval task at Room 302."

msgid "我是302的住客。309的登记还没有得到管理批准。"
msgstr "I'm the guest in Room 302. Room 309 still needs the manager's approval."

msgid "所需身份：%s · 接受后限时 %d 秒\n回1F经理身后取证 → I装备／Q切当前经理\n回3F登记台按E批准即完成，不需回302交付。"
msgstr "Required: %s · %d seconds after accepting\nTake the manager's ID on 1F → I: Equip / Q: Activate\nE at the 3F register completes the task. No return to Room 302 needed."

msgid "打开背包，把经理证放进一个佩戴槽，再按Q切为当前经理身份。"
msgstr "Open the bag and put the Manager ID in an equipment slot. Then press Q to make it your active ID."

msgid "接受后有240秒。先回一楼，在经理身后长按E取得经理工作证。"
msgstr "You have 240 seconds after accepting. Return to 1F and hold E behind the manager to take the Manager ID."

msgid "礼帽客 · 302"
msgstr "Top-Hatted Guest · 302"

msgid "二楼教学已经完成。309仍有独立的登记限制，需要管理批准。"
msgstr "The 2F tutorial is complete. Room 309 still needs a separate management approval."

msgid "接受后有240秒。沿用已取得的经理工作证，不需要再次偷证。"
msgstr "You have 240 seconds after accepting. Use your existing Manager ID; you do not need to steal it again."

msgid "309登记 · 302"
msgstr "Room 309 Registration · 302"

msgid "202已交付；继续到203完成房务申请教学。"
msgstr "Room 202 delivered. Continue to Room 203 for the room-service tutorial."

msgid "沿用经理证，I装备／Q切当前经理 → 回3F登记台按E批准309。"
msgstr "Use your Manager ID · I: Equip / Q: Activate → E at the 3F register"

msgid "302管理授权任务待接受：沿用经理证，装备并切为当前身份，回3F登记台批准。"
msgstr "Room 302 task available: equip and activate your Manager ID, then use the 3F register."

msgid "所需身份：%s · 接受后限时 %d 秒\n沿用经理工作证 → I装备／Q切当前经理\n回3F登记台按E批准即完成，不需回302交付。"
msgstr "Required: %s · %d seconds after accepting\nUse your Manager ID → I: Equip / Q: Activate\nE at the 3F register completes the task. No return to Room 302 needed."

msgid "回到302接取前，保留前序任务和已有证件，仅撤销本次309批准。"
msgstr "Return to before accepting at Room 302. Keep earlier tasks and existing IDs; undo only this task’s Room 309 approval."

msgid "沿用已有经理证，装备并切为当前身份，再到3F登记台按E批准309。"
msgstr "Use your existing Manager ID, equip and activate it, then press E at the register on 3F."

msgid "202已交付；继续到203接房务申请任务"
msgstr "Room 202 delivered · Continue to Room 203 for the room-service task"
